const {chromium}=require('@playwright/test');const assert=require('node:assert/strict');(async()=>{const b=await chromium.launch();try{const p=await b.newPage({viewport:{width:390,height:844}});const h=await p.request.get('https://aurelle.uz/api/health');assert.equal((await h.json()).version,'20260930-client-master-fixes');await p.goto('https://aurelle.uz/ru/master/madina-ha3cink8');await p.getByRole('tab',{name:/Портфолио/}).click();const photos=p.getByRole('tabpanel').locator('img');assert.equal(await photos.count(),4);await p.waitForFunction(()=>[...document.querySelectorAll('[role=tabpanel] img')].every(i=>i.complete&&i.naturalWidth>0));await p.screenshot({path:'reports/production-portfolio-20260930.png'});for(const path of ['/ru','/uz','/en','/sitemap.xml','/offline.html']){const r=await p.request.get('https://aurelle.uz'+path);assert.equal(r.status(),200);console.log('PASS',path)}console.log('PASS live version, 4 public photos loaded');}finally{await b.close()}})().catch(e=>{console.error(e);process.exitCode=1});
